	(descr "13.56 MHz PCB loop antenna, 19-turn rectangular spiral, 22 x 35 mm, ~4.7 uH. The copper is board tracks, not a custom pad: a self-crossing path gives KiCad no usable polygon, and the Overglade badge shipped with zero copper here. The 1.2 mm gap at the centre is bridged by the ST25DV04KC internal 28.5 pF (CTUN), which resonates the loop at 13.56 MHz.")
